1
00:00:00,318 --> 00:00:01,558
(COMPUTER DINGS)

2
00:00:01,753 --> 00:00:04,253
Ooh! I got one, too.

3
00:00:04,322 --> 00:00:06,492
(Stuart:)The ladies are coming to us.

4
00:00:07,959 --> 00:00:10,099
(Stuart:)Oh, man,
if I'd started this years ago,

5
00:00:10,162 --> 00:00:12,732
(Stuart:)I'd be divorced two or three times
by now.

6
00:00:13,098 --> 00:00:14,268
(COMPUTER CHIMES)

7
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:15,946
(Raj:)What...? Another one.

8
00:00:16,301 --> 00:00:18,411
You know, ifs weird.

9
00:00:18,503 --> 00:00:21,343
(Raj:)When they're reading your profile,
does it make you feel exposed?

10
00:00:21,439 --> 00:00:23,279
(Raj:)Like they see you naked?

11
00:00:24,843 --> 00:00:27,653
(Stuart:)Well, they're not running away
screaming, so, no.

12
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:32,182
(Amy:)I love Little House.

13
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,200
(Amy:)It made me want to live
on a farm so much.

14
00:00:34,286 --> 00:00:35,856
(Amy:)I tried to milk my cat.

15
00:00:39,524 --> 00:00:42,134
(Amy:)That tangy bowl of Cheerios
was not worth the stitches.

16
00:00:44,362 --> 00:00:46,812
(Sheldon:)Well, you sit back, relax,

17
00:00:46,932 --> 00:00:49,672
(Sheldon:)and enjoy a beloved
childhood memory.

18
00:00:49,968 --> 00:00:52,848
J' (LITTLE HOUSE ON THE PRAIRIE
THEME PLAYS) J'

19
00:00:54,139 --> 00:00:56,379
(Sheldon:)You see that cabin there?

